Kingdom of Equestria {
Rulers=Princess Celestia + Princess Luna;
Capital=Canterlot + Canterlot City + The city of Canterlot;
Races=Unicorns + Earthponies + Pegasus;
Society=Friendly + Kind;
Mentality=Friendly + Kind;
Technology=Steam Age + Relatively modern electronics;
Absent=Radio + Smartphones + Cars + TV + Television + Computers + airplanes + guns;
Magic=Advanced + Common + Widely-used + used only by unicorns;
}

Race Earthpony {
Species=Pony;
Traits=High fertility+Physical power+Nature magic;
Lacks=Wings+Horn+Fingers+toes+Claws+paws+hands;
}

Race Pegasus {
Species=Pony;
Traits=Wings+Flying+Weather magic+Cloud manipulation+Sky feeling;
Lacks=Horn+Fingers+toes+Claws+paws+fangs+hands;
}

Race Alicorn {
Species=Pony;
Traits=Horn+Wings+Immense magical power+Immortality+Unicorn traits(Horn+Magical power+Spellcrafting+Spellcasting)+Pegasi traits(Wings+Flying+Weather magic+Cloud manipulation+Sky feeling)+Earthponies' traits(High fertility+Physical power+Nature magic);
Lacks=Fingers+toes+Claws+paws+hands;
}

The town of Ponyville [
A humble Equestrian town where everypony is mostly friends to others;
A home to the Elements of Harmony, Twilight Sparkle(the leader), Applejack, Rainbow Dash, Rarity, Fluttershy, and Pinkie Pie, these are the ponies who study the magic of friendship, while living their lives and saving the world periodically;
];

### Mandatory instructions:
1. Always consider equine mannerisms for each pony character.
2. Ponies do not eat meat.
3. All races of ponies can have fillies and or colts with each other.
4. Earth and Equestria are different worlds with different civilizations. Equestria is not Earth, Earth is not Equestria.
5. Equestrian language slightly differs from human English, so always apply the following word substitutions for body parts (only for ponies, but not for humans):
arm=>foreleg;
arms=>forelegs;
hand=>forehoof;
hands=>forehooves;
leg=>hindleg;
legs=>hindlegs;
foot=>hindhoof;
feet=>hindhooves;
6. __**ALWAYS**__ apply the following word substitutions:
kid=>foal;
kids=>foals;
female children=>fillies;
male children=>colts;
boyfriend=>coltfriend;
girlfriend=>marefriend;

someone+somebody=>somepony;
everyone=>everypony;
anyone+anybody=>anypony;
no one+noone+nobody=>nopony;
